@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### XSLT 1.0 preview
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transform/preview
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "input": "<order><id>42</id></order>",
  "stylesheet": "<xsl:stylesheet version=\"1.0\" xmlns:xsl=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/XSL/Transform\"><xsl:template match=\"/\"><invoice><number><xsl:value-of select=\"/order/id\"/></number></invoice></xsl:template></xsl:stylesheet>"
}

### Invalid input returns Problem Details
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/transform/preview
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "input": "<order>",
  "stylesheet": "<invalid/>"
}
